*> vybe-test: cobol/evaluate_advanced/test_evaluate_88_subject
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_evaluate_advanced.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   88 IS-ACTIVE VALUE 1.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    EVALUATE IS-ACTIVE
        WHEN TRUE
            DISPLAY "ACTIVE"
        WHEN FALSE
            DISPLAY "INACTIVE"
    END-EVALUATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "ACTIVE" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ACTIVE"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ACTIVE] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

